% We have to add a wrapper to the results of pat_refine
% because its results can have to different types:
% (1) a single pattern, due to the forall case of the single case
% (2) a pattern and a pattern row, due to the row cons case
% these two types are incompatible as is

% defns
% single_pat_refine :: '' ::=
% defn
% P ▹ Q :: :: sin_pat_refining :: 'sin_pat_refining__' by

